2. **Acidic Solution**: \([H_3O^+] > [OH^-]\) (i.e., \([H_3O^+] > 10^{-7)\) M)
3. **Basic Solution**: \([H_3O^+] < [OH^-]\) (i.e., \([H_3O^+] < 10^{-7)\) M)

Since \([H_3O^+] = 10^{-4}\) M, which is greater than \(10^{-7}\) M, the solution is **acidic**.

