<start_of_turn>model
","To calculate the lattice energy of CaCl2, we can use the Born-Lande equation:

Lattice Energy = Madv * (1 - σ) * (1/r)

where:
- Madv is the Mading constant (2.21 x 10^-19 J nm)
- σ is the Mading constant correction factor (for CaCl2, it is approximately 0.35)
