   \text{Rate} = \frac{m_2 - m_1}{\Delta t} = \frac{m_2 - m_1}{t_2 - t_1}
   \]  
   The rate of disappearance of \( NH_4CNO \) is:  
   \[
   \text{Rate} = -\frac{d[NH_4CNO]}{dt} = \frac{m_1 - m_2}{t_2 - t_1}
   \]  
