1. **Flow rate (Q):**
   \[
   Q = 10 \, \text{cm}^3 \, \text{min}^{-1} = 10 \times 10^{-6} \, \text{m}^3 \, \text{min}^{-1} = 10 \times 10^{-6} \, \text{m}^3} \times \frac{1}{60 \, \text{min}} = 1.67 \times 10^{-7} \, \text{m}^3 \, \text{s}^{-1}
   \]

2. **Inner diameter (d):**
   \[
   d = 0.1 \, \text{mm} = 0.0001 \, \text{m}
   \]

3. **Cross-sectional area (A):**
   \[
   A = \pi \left(\frac{d}{2}\right)^2 = \pi \left(\frac{0.0001}{2}\right)^2 = 1.62 \times 10^{-7} \, \text{m}^2
   \]

